    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d287">

                <pb facs="0249" n="175" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg175"/>

                <head>Sir F. Bruce to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-06-17"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 17, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I beg you to thank the president of the
                    Soldiers’ National Cemetery at Gettysburg for the invitation to attend the
                    ceremony of laying the corner-stone of the monument at that place on the 4th of
                    July.</p>
                <p>I regret that circumstances put it out of my power to be present on so
                    interesting an occasion.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FREDERICK W. A. BRUCE.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
